{"id": "q0137", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 536156447, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "What is the smallest real number $x$ in the domain of the function $$g(x) = \\sqrt{(x-3)^2-(x-8)^2}~?$$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0137.wav", "input_sha256": "86aad970feea5a3456f1b04e0efa075935d88f2e150a9715bf019ffffeef19fc", "input_samples": 139800, "input_s": 8.738, "n_real_chunks": 9, "score": 0.8312, "act": 0.9995, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Assuming the function is \\[ f(x)=\\sqrt{x-3}+(2-x-8)^2 \\] the domain restriction comes from the square root: \\[ x-3 \\ge 0 \\] \\[ x \\ge 3 \\] So the smallest real number in the domain is: \\[ \\boxed{3} \\]", "expert_answer": "Assuming the function is\n\n\\[\nf(x)=\\sqrt{x-3}+(2-x-8)^2\n\\]\n\nthe domain restriction comes from the square root:\n\n\\[\nx-3 \\ge 0\n\\]\n\n\\[\nx \\ge 3\n\\]\n\nSo the **smallest real number in the domain** is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{3}\n\\]", "transcript": "What is the smallest real number x dollars in the domain of the function f x squared x minus 3 2 minus x minus 8 squared, solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.77, "expert_s": 8.5, "expert_input_samples": 139800, "expert_input_s": 8.738, "expert_input_sha256": "86aad970feea5a3456f1b04e0efa075935d88f2e150a9715bf019ffffeef19fc", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 7.925, "relay_synth_ms": 32726, "onset_chunk": 8, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 298, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 298, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0137_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "a3361e7ab2154bb17f2d9f831b74cae951909865c7d904032715dd7336583dda", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 59.96}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0137_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "9fb4932ed149e07258e57e99c1380d2c4b31ffa7ce947d4f3319a400dcb9e636", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0137_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "95bb149b228a9b68a4ff6ad5006d43c44868158192ec129a238fbed4888f4fc0", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.96}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.08, 1.144, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.083, 2.147, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.079, 3.141, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.077, 4.143, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.072, 5.128, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.07, 6.127, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.088, 7.157, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.071, 8.13, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 8.738, 8.822, 9.348, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.738, 10.126, 10.685, 0, 23040, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 8.738, "last_real_feed_done": 8.822, "onset": 9.348, "gate_read_done": 9.348, "fire": 9.348, "candidate_first_pcm": 9.348, "stall_note": 9.35, "stall_first_pcm": 10.035, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 10.685, "expert_req": 9.35, "expert_resp": 18.61, "relay_synth_start": 18.61, "relay_first_pcm": 19.404, "relay_synth_end": 51.337, "first_any_pcm": 9.348, "first_answer_pcm": 19.404, "session_end": 52.073}, "ttfa_answer_s": 10.666, "ttfa_any_s": 0.61}
{"id": "q0164", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4220239072, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "Finding all the real roots of the equation $\\sqrt{x^2+x+1}+\\sqrt{2 x^2+x+5}=\\sqrt{x^2-3 x+13}$. Return the answer as a list with ascending order.\n\nA. [0.2807764064, -1.7807764064]\nB. [-2.2807764064, 1.2807764064]\nC. [1.7807764064, -0.2807764064]\nD. []\nE. [-1.2807764064, 2.2807764064]\nF. [0.2807764064, 2.7807764064]\nG. [-3.7807764064, 0.7807764064]\nH. [-0.2807764064, 1.7807764064]\nI. [-1.7807764064, 0.2807764064]\nJ. [0, 2]\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0164.wav", "input_sha256": "c04299adfe3bfefe9ceb2ba67213992c935c97066e07c1e850ce2f87e24b776e", "input_samples": 953600, "input_s": 59.6, "n_real_chunks": 60, "score": 0.9737, "act": 0.9958, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "A. [0.280764, 1.786404]", "expert_answer": "**A. [0.280764, 1.786404]**", "transcript": "Finding all the real roots of the equation dollar x to the fourth plus plus one plus sqrt 2x plus x plus 5, x squared minus 3x plus 13 dollars. Return the answer as a list with ascending order. A, 0.280764, 1.786404. B, minus 2.28064, 1.2864. C, 1.7807492 or point 3. D, E, 2. F, 0.28064, 2.7804.\n", "asr_s": 1.76, "expert_s": 16.61, "expert_input_samples": 592000, "expert_input_s": 37.0, "expert_input_sha256": "ba4b82cd32013dac629c63109eb21e3a46ceefca0508b508b59f37e82e950a3d", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 16.878, "relay_synth_ms": 3972, "onset_chunk": 36, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 249, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 249, "audi