{"id": "q0495", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 232739410, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "创建一个程序将动物分类到不同的组中。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0495.wav", "input_sha256": "7b886e4768c29eb5cc29c2f6d4325794a5bbd188bb170da8d0c4e8eea3c8f8a4", "input_samples": 63400, "input_s": 3.962, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.3576, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "我们可以创建一个程序来帮助我们将动物分类到不同的组中。比如说，我们可以按照它们的生活环境来分，像水生动物、陆地动物或者空中飞行动物。或者也可以按照它们的食性来分，比如肉食动物、植食动物和杂食动物。还有人们可以根据它们是哺乳动物、鸟类、爬行动物或两栖动物等进行分类。这个程序可能会有一个输入框，让用户输入动物的名字，然后根据数据库里的信息自动归类到合适的类别里去。最后它可能会显示出该动物属于哪一组，以及简单的解释为什么这样分。这样既方便又有趣，特别适合学习生物知识的", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0495_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "afbdc874e96f35c04dc2816fb6bad9f9957a9b3f62333b1f9b2f0c08bca3e60b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 59.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.07, 1.127, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.07, 2.129, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.07, 3.126, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.962, 4.037, 4.097, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.963, 5.037, 5.216, 0, 0, 0], [5, 0, 5.963, 6.036, 6.708, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.963, 7.036, 7.701, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.963, 8.038, 8.711, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.963, 9.035, 9.723, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.963, 10.037, 10.711, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.963, 11.042, 11.763, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.963, 